V.Crew Connect is easy to use and free for all V.Group seafarers. You can quickly create an account using your registered e-mail ID.

App features:
-	Upload documents and track document validity and expiry dates;  
-	Track your next assignment notice and advise of your availability to join the vessel;
-	Update your profile and inform any contact changes easily;
-	Monitor your tasks to complete before you embark;
-	Sign your contract electronically;
-	View your sea service history and a summary of your experience;
-       Live Chat Support;

